"The Night Order built the island into the first blight dungeon, meant to swallow Abylport."
"Its core was the Divine Bracelet of Four Elements; Liora purified it and took it."
"The lit tunnel held the mages' lounge: couches, bookshelves and an alchemy corner."
"The foul tunnel was the Order's corruption factory, venting miasma."
"The dark tunnel led to a bone cavern where a tier 5 skinweaver lived; it is dead."
"Liora killed Order mages Xernon, Franceska and Leonard on the island."
